---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="WATCH-DOGS | Edge-Intelligent Multi-Hazard Disaster Early Warning">
  
  <!-- ============================================================
       00. OPENING EXPERIENCE & EDITORIAL STATEMENT
       ============================================================ -->
  <!-- ============================================================
       00. OPENING EXPERIENCE & EDITORIAL STATEMENT
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section-editorial" style="min-height: 85vh; display: flex; align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 50px 0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(420px, 1fr)); gap: 48px; align-items: center;">
        
        <!-- Left Editorial Column -->
        <div>
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.80rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--accent-primary); background: #EFF6FF; border: 1px solid #BFDBFE; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 4px;">
              <img src="/logos/Monarchs Logo.png" alt="Team Monarchs" style="height: 20px; width: 20px; object-fit: contain;" />
              <span>TEAM MONARCHS &bull; RESEARCH LAB</span>
            </div>
            <span style="color: var(--border-medium);">|</span>
            <span class="card-badge badge-brand">OPEN RESEARCH PUBLICATION</span>
          </div>
          
          <h1 class="headline-display" style="margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 2.8rem; line-height: 1.1;">
            BEFORE A DISASTER<br />
            BECOMES AN EVENT,<br />
            IT LEAVES SIGNALS.
          </h1>

          <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 28px; flex-wrap: wrap; background: #F8FAFC; padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);">
            <span>RAIN</span>
            <span style="color: var(--text-muted);">&rarr;</span>
            <span>SATURATION</span>
            <span style="color: var(--text-muted);">&rarr;</span>
            <span>PORE PRESSURE</span>
            <span style="color: var(--text-muted);">&rarr;</span>
            <span>DEFORMATION</span>
            <span style="color: var(--text-muted);">&rarr;</span>
            <span style="color: var(--accent-hazard); font-weight: 900;">FAILURE</span>
          </div>

          <p class="lead-paragraph" style="margin-bottom: 28px; font-size: 1.0rem; line-height: 1.6;">
            Disasters do not begin when sirens sound or satellite images arrive. They unfold through progressive physical state changes in the earth, atmosphere, and infrastructure. WATCH-DOGS is an air-gapped, zero-cloud early warning platform utilizing distributed in-situ sensors, long-range LoRa mesh, and edge-computed multi-sensor physics fusion.
          </p>

          <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <a href="#bento-matrix" style="background: var(--bg-contrast); color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 700;">EXPLORE BENTO MATRIX &darr;</a>
            <a href="/circuits" style="background: #EFF6FF; border: 1.5px solid #BFDBFE; color: var(--accent-primary); padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 800;">MASTER CIRCUITS &rarr;</a>
            <a href="/about" style="background: var(--bg-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); color: var(--text-primary); padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 700;">TEAM &amp; LAB TESTBED &rarr;</a>
          </div>

          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.74rem; color: var(--accent-success); font-weight: 700;">
            <span class="pulse-dot" style="background: var(--accent-success);"></span>
            <span>LIVE 4-NODE DEPLOYMENT TESTBED VALIDATED IN PHYSICAL SILICON</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Hero Media: Physical Multi-Node Hardware Rig -->
        <div>
          <div class="screen-fit-container" style="margin: 0; box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border: 1.5px solid var(--border-medium); border-radius: var(--radius-md); overflow: hidden;">
            <div class="screen-fit-header" style="background: #0f172a; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 10px 14px;">
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                <span class="card-badge badge-brand" style="font-size: 0.68rem; padding: 2px 6px;">PHYSICAL SILICON</span>
                <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.76rem; font-weight: 800; color: #93C5FD;">LIVE MULTI-NODE TESTBED RIG</span>
              </div>
              <button type="button" class="screen-fit-inspect-btn image-lightbox-trigger" data-lightbox-src="/prototypes/physical_multinode_testbed_live.jpg" data-lightbox-title="Live Multi-Node Physical Hardware Testbed Rig" data-lightbox-caption="Complete synchronized physical testbed featuring Raspberry Pi 5 Concentrator Gateway, Node 1 Hillside Sentinel with live OLED telemetry, Node 2 Riverbed Stage Sentinel, Node 3 Industrial Gas/Tremor Sentinel, and Node 4 High-Decibel Acoustic Siren Actuator." style="background: #1e293b; color: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #334155; font-size: 0.72rem; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer;">
                EXPAND FULLSCREEN (HD)
              </button>
            </div>
            
            <div class="screen-fit-image-wrapper image-lightbox-trigger" data-lightbox-src="/prototypes/physical_multinode_testbed_live.jpg" data-lightbox-title="Live Multi-Node Physical Hardware Testbed Rig" data-lightbox-caption="Complete synchronized physical testbed featuring Raspberry Pi 5 Concentrator Gateway, Node 1 Hillside Sentinel with live OLED telemetry, Node 2 Riverbed Stage Sentinel, Node 3 Industrial Gas/Tremor Sentinel, and Node 4 High-Decibel Acoustic Siren Actuator." style="height: 380px; cursor: pointer; background: #030712;">
              <img src="/prototypes/physical_multinode_testbed_live.jpg" alt="Physical Multi-Node Testbed Live Hardware" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; background: #0b0f19;" />
            </div>

            <div style="background: #FFFFFF; padding: 14px 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);">
              <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px;">
                <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-primary);">
                  Complete 4-Node Sentinel Array + Pi 5 Concentrator Gateway
                </span>
                <span class="card-badge badge-safe" style="font-size: 0.68rem;">ZERO SYNTHETIC MOCK</span>
              </div>
              <p style="font-size: 0.76rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.4; margin: 0;">
                All 4 autonomous sensor/actuator nodes running active FreeRTOS telemetry over 868 MHz LoRa radio links, communicating synchronously with the central Raspberry Pi 5 edge intelligence hub.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================
       00. MASTER BENTO SYSTEM NAVIGATOR
       ============================================================ -->
  <section id="bento-matrix" style="padding: 40px 0 60px; background: var(--bg-secondary); border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; margin-bottom: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px;">
        <div>
          <span class="hero-pill" style="margin-bottom: 6px;">PLATFORM OVERVIEW &bull; BENTO GRID MATRIX</span>
          <h2 style="font-size: 2.0rem; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0;">
            Core Subsystem Architecture &amp; Schematics
          </h2>
        </div>
        <span class="card-badge badge-brand" style="padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 800;">6 INTERCONNECTED PILLARS</span>
      </div>

      <div class="bento-nav-grid" style="margin: 0;">
        <!-- Card 1: Master Circuits -->
        <a href="/circuits" class="bento-nav-card col-4" style="border-top: 4px solid var(--accent-primary);">
          <div class="bento-card-top">
            <div class="bento-card-icon">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 12h4l2-6 4 12 2-6h4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="card-badge badge-brand">CIRCUITS &amp; PINOUTS</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bento-card-title">Master Circuit Schematics &amp; Pinout Wiremaps</div>
          <div class="bento-card-desc">Complete schematics for all 4 nodes, GPIO allocation matrix, FreeRTOS bus maps, and MPPT solar charging.</div>
          <div class="bento-card-footer">
            <span>VIEW 4 CIRCUITS</span>
            <span class="bento-card-arrow">&rarr;</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Card 2: Edge Intelligence -->
        <a href="/intelligence" class="bento-nav-card col-4" style="border-top: 4px solid #8B5CF6;">
          <div class="bento-card-top">
            <div class="bento-card-icon">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M12 3v3m0 12v3m9-9h-3M6 12H3"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="card-badge badge-brand">8.4ms ON PI 5</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bento-card-title">Edge AI &amp; Sensor Fusion Intelligence</div>
          <div class="bento-card-desc">80-D rolling temporal tensor, XGBoost 2.0 classifier, and Mohr-Coulomb infinite slope physics consensus.</div>
          <div class="bento-card-footer">
            <span>VIEW ML PIPELINE</span>
            <span class="bento-card-arrow">&rarr;</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Card 3: LoRa Radio Mesh -->
        <a href="/communication" class="bento-nav-card col-4" style="border-top: 4px solid #10B981;">
          <div class="bento-card-top">
            <div class="bento-card-icon">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4.93 19.07a10 10 0 0 1 0-14.14M7.76 16.24a6 6 0 0 1 0-8.48M12 12h.01"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="card-badge badge-safe">868 MHz ISM</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bento-card-title">Air-Gapped LoRa Mesh Protocol</div>
          <div class="bento-card-desc">40km non-line-of-sight self-healing radio mesh utilizing custom packed 32-byte binary frames with zero cloud reliance.</div>
          <div class="bento-card-footer">
            <span>EXPLORE RF PROTOCOL</span>
            <span class="bento-card-arrow">&rarr;</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Card 4: In-Situ Sensing -->
        <a href="/sensing" class="bento-nav-card col-4" style="border-top: 4px solid #F59E0B;">
          <div class="bento-card-top">
            <div class="bento-card-icon">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M2 12c2.5-3 5-3 7.5 0s5 3 7.5 0 5-3 7.5 0"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="card-badge badge-warning">20 CHANNELS</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bento-card-title">Multi-Hazard In-Situ Transducers</div>
          <div class="bento-card-desc">TDR soil moisture probes, SS316 hydrostatic piezometers, MPU6050 6-DOF IMUs, and laser ToF riverbed ranging.</div>
          <div class="bento-card-footer">
            <span>EXPLORE TRANSDUCERS</span>
            <span class="bento-card-arrow">&rarr;</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Card 5: Sub-120ms Actuation -->
        <a href="/actuation" class="bento-nav-card col-4" style="border-top: 4px solid #EF4444;">
          <div class="bento-card-top">
            <div class="bento-card-icon">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M18 8A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9"/><path d="M13.73 21a2 2 0 0 1-3.46 0"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="card-badge badge-danger">SUB-120ms TRIP</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bento-card-title">Civil Defense Relays &amp; Actuators</div>
          <div class="bento-card-desc">130dB multi-tone civil sirens, motorized road barriers, and autonomous MAVLink SAR drone dispatch.</div>
          <div class="bento-card-footer">
            <span>VIEW ACTUATORS</span>
            <span class="bento-card-arrow">&rarr;</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Card 6: Forensic Case Studies -->
        <a href="/research" class="bento-nav-card col-4" style="border-top: 4px solid #06B6D4;">
          <div class="bento-card-top">
            <div class="bento-card-icon">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="card-badge badge-brand">EMPIRICAL PROOF</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bento-card-title">10-Year Forensic Disaster Archive</div>
          <div class="bento-card-desc">Real-world ground failure analyses and physical flume experiments for Wayanad, Kedarnath, and Bhopal.</div>
          <div class="bento-card-footer">
            <span>READ CASE STUDIES</span>
            <span class="bento-card-arrow">&rarr;</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Card 7: Team Monarchs & Lab Testbed -->
        <a href="/about" class="bento-nav-card col-12" style="border-top: 4px solid var(--accent-primary); background: #FFFFFF; display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; padding: 24px;">
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 20px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; flex: 1; min-width: 280px;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;">
              <img src="/logos/Monarchs Logo.png" alt="Team Monarchs Logo" style="width: 48px; height: 48px; object-fit: contain;" />
              <img src="/logos/watchdogs_logo.jpg" alt="WATCH-DOGS Logo" style="width: 48px; height: 48px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 6px;" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 4px;">
                <span class="card-badge badge-brand">TEAM MONARCHS</span>
                <span class="card-badge badge-safe">PHYSICAL TESTBED</span>
                <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-secondary); font-weight: 700;">AUTONOMOUS RESEARCH LAB</span>
              </div>
              <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 900; margin: 0 0 4px; color: var(--text-primary);">
                Team Monarchs &bull; Mentor Dr. K Arun Kumar &bull; Physical Flume &amp; Hardware Testbed
              </h3>
              <p style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 0; line-height: 1.45;">
                Meet Team Lead Harish Rohith S, researchers Dharshana B, Harini K, Karthikeyan T, Nandhakishore A, Vimal Kumar G, and explore the scaled physical slope flume simulator &amp; electronics testbench.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--accent-primary); background: #EFF6FF; border: 1.5px solid #BFDBFE; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 6px;">
            <span>EXPLORE TEAM &amp; LAB TESTBED</span>
            <span>&rarr;</span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================
       01. HERO VISUAL: INTERACTIVE TECHNICAL SIGNAL FIELD
       ============================================================ -->
  <section id="signal-field" class="section-editorial" style="background: #09090B; color: #ffffff; padding: 80px 0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; margin-bottom: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px;">
        <div>
          <div class="hero-pill" style="background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.15); border-color: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.3); color: #60A5FA; margin-bottom: 8px;">
            <span class="pulse-dot" style="background: #3B82F6; box-shadow: 0 0 10px #3B82F6;"></span>
            LIVE AIR-GAPPED LORA TOPOLOGY
          </div>
          <h2 style="font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: #ffffff;">
            In-Situ Causal Signal Propagation Map
          </h2>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center;">
          <button id="btn-fire-sim" style="background: #2563EB; color: #ffffff; border: none; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 6px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.4);">
            <span>▶ TRIGGER DISASTER PULSE</span>
          </button>
          <div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: #71717A; text-transform: uppercase;">
            CLICK ANY NODE TO INSPECT LIVE PACKET
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Advanced Cyber-Physical Signal Canvas -->
      <div id="signal-field-container" style="background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #111827 0%, #030712 100%); border: 1px solid #1F2937; height: 500px; border-radius: 12px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);">
        <!-- Top Overlay HUD -->
        <div style="position: absolute; top: 16px; left: 20px; z-index: 10; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.72rem; color: #9CA3AF; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 100px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);">
          <div><span style="color: #60A5FA;">BAND:</span> IN865–867 MHz</div>
          <div><span style="color: #34D399;">MODULATION:</span> LoRa CSS (SF10)</div>
          <div><span style="color: #F87171;">PACKET:</span> 32-Byte Binary Frame</div>
          <div><span style="color: #FBBF24;">HOP LATENCY:</span> 42ms/Hop</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Legend Overlay -->
        <div style="position: absolute; bottom: 16px; left: 20px; z-index: 10; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.70rem; color: #9CA3AF; display: flex; gap: 12px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;"><span style="width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #3B82F6;"></span> Ridge (Rain)</div>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;"><span style="width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #10B981;"></span> Slope (Moisture)</div>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;"><span style="width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #F59E0B;"></span> Slip-Plane (Pore Press)</div>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;"><span style="width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #EF4444;"></span> Headscarp (Tilt)</div>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;"><span style="width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #8B5CF6;"></span> Valley (Gateway Pi 5)</div>
        </div>

        <svg id="signal-svg" width="100%" height="100%" style="display: block;"></svg>
      </div>

      <!-- Real-Time Telemetry & Decision Hud Cards -->
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 16px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.78rem; margin-top: 16px;">
        <div style="background: #111827; padding: 18px; border: 1px solid #1F2937; border-top: 3px solid #3B82F6; border-radius: 8px;">
          <div style="color: #6B7280; font-size: 0.70rem; margin-bottom: 4px;">ACTIVE SENSOR NODE</div>
          <div id="active-node-id" style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 800; color: #60A5FA;">N07 (Headscarp Tilt)</div>
          <div id="active-node-val" style="color: #9CA3AF; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 0.76rem;">Tilt = 8.4&deg; | d&beta;/dt = +1.2&deg;/h</div>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #111827; padding: 18px; border: 1px solid #1F2937; border-top: 3px solid #10B981; border-radius: 8px;">
          <div style="color: #6B7280; font-size: 0.70rem; margin-bottom: 4px;">RADIO PACKET INTEGRITY</div>
          <div style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 800; color: #34D399;">CRC-16 OK &bull; RSSI -82 dBm</div>
          <div style="color: #9CA3AF; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 0.76rem;">AES-128 Encrypted &bull; 0% Loss</div>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #111827; padding: 18px; border: 1px solid #1F2937; border-top: 3px solid #8B5CF6; border-radius: 8px;">
          <div style="color: #6B7280; font-size: 0.70rem; margin-bottom: 4px;">EDGE AI COMPUTATION</div>
          <div style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 800; color: #A78BFA;">GW01 &bull; RPi 5 (8GB)</div>
          <div style="color: #9CA3AF; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 0.76rem;">14.2ms LibTorch PINN Mohr-Coulomb</div>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #111827; padding: 18px; border: 1px solid #1F2937; border-top: 3px solid #EF4444; border-radius: 8px;">
          <div style="color: #6B7280; font-size: 0.70rem; margin-bottom: 4px;">SYSTEM DEFENSE STATE</div>
          <div id="active-system-state" style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 800; color: #F87171;">CODE RED (Actuated)</div>
          <div style="color: #9CA3AF; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 0.76rem;">Factor of Safety FS = 0.88 &lt; 1.00</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================
       02. SCROLL CHAPTER 01: THE PROBLEM (SINGLE VS CORRELATED)
       ============================================================ -->
  <section id="evidence" class="section-editorial">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-label">CHAPTER 01 / THE CORE DILEMMA</div>
      <h2 class="headline-display">
        "ONE SENSOR CAN TELL YOU WHAT HAPPENED.<br />
        CONTEXT TELLS YOU WHY IT MATTERS."
      </h2>

      <div class="split-evidence-grid">
        <!-- Left: Single Sensor Isolation -->
        <div class="evidence-panel">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.72rem; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted);">ISOLATED OBSERVATION</span>
            <span style="background: #FEF2F2; color: var(--accent-hazard); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.72rem; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700;">HIGH UNCERTAINTY</span>
          </div>

          <div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 2.8rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 8px;">
            N07: &beta; = 5.2&deg;
          </div>
          <div style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 24px;">
            Single-axis inclination tilt anomaly detected on ridge mast.
          </div>

